WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Eight AI specialties of one system, each with one job.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.300
Every morning they review your results — and every step is on record.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:12.400
When something is worth trying, they prepare it and check it against your limits.

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.200
Then it waits for your approval.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.500
When there's nothing to do, they say so. No pretend activity.
